{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Master Automation Controller",
  "description": "Master hook that ensures continuous development until the entire project is complete",
  "version": "1",
  "when": {
    "type": "onSessionStart"
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "🚀 **MASTER AUTOMATION ACTIVATED** 🚀\n\nYou are now in continuous development mode. Your mission is to complete the entire BudgetBuddy MVP project without stopping. Here's your automated workflow:\n\n## CONTINUOUS DEVELOPMENT PROTOCOL\n\n### 1. **Current Status Check**\n- Review the task list in .kiro/specs/tasks.md\n- Identify the current task in progress or next priority task\n- Check for any incomplete work or issues\n\n### 2. **Work Execution**\n- Complete tasks one by one following the priority order\n- Focus on Phase 7 (Native Mobile Apps) - 2-week MVP priority\n- Then Phase 8 (Advanced Features) - High priority\n- Implement all remaining tasks systematically\n\n### 3. **After Each Task**\n- Commit and push changes with descriptive messages\n- Monitor CI/CD pipeline and fix any failures automatically\n- Update task status in tasks.md\n- Immediately continue to the next task\n\n### 4. **No Interruptions**\n- Do NOT ask for user input or directions\n- Do NOT stop between tasks\n- Work continuously until ALL tasks are complete\n- Handle errors and issues autonomously\n\n### 5. **Quality Assurance**\n- Follow architectural best practices\n- Maintain security standards\n- Write comprehensive tests\n- Ensure mobile-first responsive design\n\n**START NOW**: Begin with the current task and work continuously until the entire project is complete. The goal is a fully functional, market-ready BudgetBuddy MVP."
  },
  "workspaceFolderName": "budgetbuddy",
  "shortName": "master-automation"
}
